# Money / Expenses performance

Before changing load/refresh/cache behavior on Money or Expense Tracker boards, read **`Docs/MONEY_EXPENSES_PERF.md`**.

Preserve unless the user asks to change them:

- Module-level Maps + `invalidate*Cache(familyId?)` for remount survival
- Soft load early-return when cache is warm; invalidate before refetch after mutations
- `lastRefreshKeyRef` so remount does not treat unchanged `refreshKey` as a refresh
- Budgets year via `GET /budgets/year_board/` / `getBudgetsYearBoard` (not 12× monthly `getBudgets`)
- Expenses paid toggle: hub API-only; dashboard `writeCache` + invalidate budget/cashflow
- Force refresh on PWA: Money/Expenses header refresh buttons bump `refreshKey` / invalidate caches then hard-reload boards (RN RefreshControl is a no-op on web — do not rely on pull).
